1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,080
M: You didn't forget to call the Maintenance Department to take a look at our machine, did you?

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:10,660
W: I made the call to Jack as soon as I got into work at 9 this morning, but he said he had many rounds to make today.

3
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:14,380
According to him, the earliest he can come is around 4.

4
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,500
M: That's a bit late.

5
00:00:16,115 --> 00:00:20,780
I have an appointment with Mr. Smith at 5, and it will take me at least an hour to get there.

6
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,970
We need someone here to explain the problem to him.

7
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,000
W: My meeting with my client got canceled.

8
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,540
I'll stick around and tell Jack about the problem.

9
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,105
You go right ahead and meet Mr. Smith.
